{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">瑞银：标普500三季度盈利门槛偏低但上修强劲</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">标普500三季度业绩期即将展开，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>策略团队给出的核心判断是：市场对盈利减速已有定价，但卖方<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>幅度异常强劲，实际增速可能落在接近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>的位置。这份报告最值得看的不是增速本身，而是“低门槛”与“强<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>”这两个信号同时出现时，市场定价是否已经充分反映了减速。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。标普500三季度EPS预期同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.3%</span>，若按历史上约3个百分点的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>幅度推算，最终可能接近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>，这将是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2021年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>以来第二高的增速，仅次于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>。但近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">70%</span>的公司预期EPS增速低于二季度，中位数增速从14.6%节奏变化至9.1%。与此同时，自二季度业绩期开始以来，中位数公司已回调7%。UBS的判断是，减速已被定价。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>的力度更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>预期<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.8%</span>，其中Tech+<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.6%</span>，非Tech+上修0.8%。2026年全年非Tech+的EPS增速预期自6月以来已上调7个百分点，而典型情况下这个数字是下降约1个百分点。这里的分化在于：市场共识仍预期减速，但分析师的行为在往相反方向走。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW2Kb5VMK0cFS9AD5laP84KeTKHl8DE7pvntWHRTo6ciaLKgYUvMUGnlPGU83JsdibADYYBiaIcAqC1C4sZPPwq6qB4Y4HA9NIXic8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">Tech+仍是增长主引擎，但内部结构在变化</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Tech+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>营收增速预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31.1%</span>，与<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30.7%</span>基本持平；EPS增速预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54.2%</span>节奏变化至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.7%</span>。半导体继续领跑，EPS增速预期达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">130%</span>。Tech+剔除Big 6后，EPS增速预期大幅加速至100.4%，美光一家就贡献了标普500 EPS增速的5.6个百分点。标普500剔除美光、英伟达、博通和桑德斯克后，EPS增速降至13.5%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Big 6内部差异明显：英伟达EPS增速预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">89.0%</span>，微软<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.4%</span>，谷歌<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.5%</span>，苹果<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.5%</span>，亚马逊<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.8%</span>，Meta为-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.3%</span>。云业务是另一个关键变量。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>预计超大规模云厂商三季度营收同比增长60%，高于二季度的50%，也高于市场共识的56%。未来四个季度云营收预计达5740亿美元，比共识高约15%。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 云营收增速从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>，这个变化比EPS增速本身更值得关注。简单说，云业务是Tech+资本开支和营收之间的传导环节，增速<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>意味着需求端仍在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>；后续更值得看的是，这一加速能否在四季度延续，以及资本开支是否同步跟进。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXyT3iajnuOYwLVwQibWsQyicUHDwF0lzqOtWFvWXLtn42p5QoSRJhZibVfFw7Iiaj4pcuaxVvKczjhPCv8bWia1G2JAqPKhSHQygKWY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">非Tech+增长在减速，但全年预期反而在上调</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">标普500剔除Tech+后，三季度EPS增速预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.6%</span>，远低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.8%</span>。11个板块和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">73%</span>的公司仍预期正增长，但电信和必需消费最弱，增速仅略高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。利润率预期在必需消费、公用事业、电信、医疗、REITs、资金和剔除波音的工业板块均出现调整。剔除Tech+和能源后，标普500 EPS增速降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.0%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">资金板块是最大的影响项，EPS增速预期仅<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.0%</span>，较上季度的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21.2%</span>和去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.9%</span>大幅回落。剔除资金，指数盈利增速为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31.3%</span>。材料是Tech+之外第二强的板块，EPS增速预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30.4%</span>，但低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.2%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUv2jd6MsG0PWXhhw3oG2LqwHFBFf5fAbnjDmRcDkkCfG6Hg6UzKNL4CvExsicDofLbJEg3PVXaf230enu6ibPvCDDM1Y0zMjkFk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Leo<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW9icxsXAWRPzibASwUTmF9tVbb4a2GicSctQRNf4tYIEKs2xaiaUJlqnM3kffSicjaIbRibZkGHqicHegeSoTb3LtRj5qanLU3O0GgAE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 78-UBS-US Equity Strategy-Low bar and strong revisions into 3Q earnings-261013</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
